cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use FireTwin in your research, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "FireTwin: A Research-Grade Wildfire Digital Twin"
abstract: "FireTwin is a research-grade wildfire digital twin that combines satellite observations, weather, terrain, and vegetation with physics-guided machine learning to produce probabilistic fire-spread forecasts and evaluate simulated containment strategies."
